# Hand-maintained corrections to providers.lock, which is generated from pi.
#
#   <provider> <host>   add a host the generator cannot derive (per-account or
#                       per-region hosts, sign-in hosts built at runtime)
#   !<host>             never allow this host, even though pi's code names it
#                       (documentation links, not API endpoints)
#
# `*` matches one DNS label; a leading `*.` matches one or more.
# If a provider fails to connect, `pitainer denied` shows what the proxy refused.

!docs.aws.amazon.com
!cloud.google.com

amazon-bedrock bedrock-runtime.*.amazonaws.com
amazon-bedrock sts.*.amazonaws.com
google-vertex *-aiplatform.googleapis.com
google-vertex aiplatform.googleapis.com
google-vertex oauth2.googleapis.com
github-copilot github.com
github-copilot api.github.com
